# Roadmap {id="nm-roadmap"}

::summary{id="nm-roadmap-summary"}
The loop Noma is closing is **conversation → decision → code → verified
deploy**, run by people and agents under one permission model (`PLAN.md`
§23.22). All five steps of that roadmap have merged to `main` but are not
yet released. The near-term job is to ship them, run Noma on itself
(dogfooding), and then work down the scale and enterprise gaps listed in
`docs/status-2026-09-25.md` §5 and `docs/enterprise.noma`.
::

Status words: **shipped** = in a tagged release; **merged** = on `main`,
listed under `CHANGELOG.md` `[Unreleased]`; **open** = not built. This
page was written on 2026-09-27; check `CHANGELOG.md` for anything newer.

